HL7 FHIR R4 core package (crates/fhir/fixtures/r4)
  Derived from hl7.fhir.r4.core 4.0.1 by crates/fhir/generate-r4.py, which keeps the
  StructureDefinition, SearchParameter, CodeSystem, ValueSet and ConceptMap resources.
  HL7 International publishes the package under CC0-1.0, as its package.json declares.
  https://hl7.org/fhir/

Other test packages (crates/fhir/fixtures/*)
  The remaining directories are small packages written for the test suites. Several are
  named after HL7 packages (hl7.fhir.uv.sdc, hl7.fhir.uv.extensions.r4, hl7.terminology.r4,
  and others) and are slices or imitations of them, not complete copies. Each has a
  package.json naming it.

FHIRPath test suite (crates/fhirpath/tests/hl7/)
  tests-fhir-r4.xml and its input resources are the FHIRPath test suite that HL7 maintains
  in https://github.com/FHIR/fhir-test-cases (Apache License 2.0).

